security that we'll get into.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:01.560
Developer services is
where you host a portal

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:03.510
as a primary feature.

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:07.045
And then that enables all
of the other experiences

00:03:07.045 --> 00:03:09.420
that the consuming developer
will have when they interact

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:11.220
with your API program--

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.370
and then analytics
services to give you

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:17.010
the ability to measure the
program from end to end.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:19.740
Management services
really is the foundation

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:24.780
