APIs and what they can do.

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.250
All of these things
make it very easy

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.580
for you to consume our APIs.

00:04:51.580 --> 00:04:54.280
And you should be thinking the
same way about your own APIs.

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.690
Think of them as products.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.490
And you're marketing
these products

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.190
