going to consume them.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.674
And especially in the case
where there are alternatives,

00:05:03.674 --> 00:05:05.590
you need to make that a
really good experience

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:10.000
for those developers so that
their time to first response

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.190
is very short, often
measured in seconds.

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:17.395
So as an API consumer, if I go
