00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:39.080
and be able to evaluate and make
business decisions about which

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:43.430
APIs to promote, which
APIs might need work,

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:48.107
as well as operational insights
for working on performance

00:06:48.107 --> 00:06:49.190
and these kinds of things.

